          %h2#general_theory General theory
          %p
            We use the general tools for formulating notions in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+differential+geometry"} higher differential geometry
            as discussed at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometry+of+physics"} geometry of physics
          .num_defn
            %h6#definition Definition
            %p We write
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi DL
